{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alchemixum is a cute lil' mixing game!<br>Mix elements starting from the four basic &quot;air, earth, fire and water&quot; and discover hundreds of combinations, and complete the Alchemixum. But not to worry, you won't be alone because you're part of a crew of space alchemists, them being: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Canva, a little hyperactive fairy who will help you with the game's customization, occasionally telling you jokes to lighten the mood...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gaze, a studious critter who will help you progress further giving you hints towards element combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And Figura, she will assist you with the game's settings and some more technical things, make sure to report any bugs you may encounter to her!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of elements to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several quality of life features based on feedback from other games from the same genre</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scenery mode, resize, rotate and rearrange elements to create cute little scenes or goofy lookin' monstrosities using the stickers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new options of wallpaper for the mixing area and music for the game by discovering new elements!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is still under development so a lot might and will change!</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Shiny?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3548800/0513d96fc19b26fc7244e30c73ab81498e100278.jpg"},{"name":"Its Elemental!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3548800/c665ebc566fcc55e7aefa44e788e0c98b45feddd.jpg"},{"name":"bird.","path":"https://c